Q7: How does DataFrame immutability affect data cleaning?

Spark DataFrames are immutable, meaning they cannot be modified directly. Every cleaning operation creates a new DataFrame.

Example:

df_new = df.drop("old_column")

df_renamed = df.withColumnRenamed("name", "customer_name")

