Q9: Why handle null values before aggregations?

Null values can:

Produce incorrect results.
Cause averages to be misleading.
Lead to unexpected errors during calculations.
Reduce data quality and reliability.

Cleaning nulls before sum(), avg(), or other aggregations ensures accurate analysis.

